<title>UK: Royal Bank of Scotland ups UK base rate.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank of Scotland ups UK base rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Bank of Scotland Group Plc said on Wednesday it was raising its base lending rate by one quarter point to 6.0 percent in the wake of a similar move by the Bank of England.</p>
</text>
